  ('chandan-lavender', 'Chandan Lavender', 'Creamy sandalwood with calm lavender and bergamot, softened by white musk and vanilla. Relaxed, smooth and elegant.', 749, '/products/scenes/chandan-lavender.webp', array['/products/scenes/chandan-lavender.webp', '/products/bottles/chandan-lavender.webp'], 'SAHUMäRIO Chandan Lavender Eau de Parfum 50 ml bottle among its notes: sandalwood, lavender', 'Bergamot · Mandarin · Lavender · Sandalwood · White musk · Vanilla', '50 ml', 'Woody aromatic', 'Creamy sandalwood and lavender', 'Every day, office and evenings', 'Unisex', false, true, 210),
